{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6:000013:note_appended:bob-cli-an.6.6.6.4:7727eb8a306abb8dfbd5b153af1a27ae9fb09bd8598344e81f63836056f5bc03","timestamp":"2026-10-24T10:08:10Z","actor":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.4","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-an.6.6.6.4","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Baseline: bob-cli-al reproduced from description + harness file:explicit:dd078a92f55551184b77dfc7 (authored=new commits |old). Generation guard existed in fetch handler but submit committed any typed row and the completion handler overwrote rows without any label check. Fix (bob-mac-capture, thin-client safe): prompt state gains suggestionAuthoredLabel; every label edit/cycle untags rows; submit commits only a fresh typed/match row else bob-grammar authored replacement (|label / |\"multi word\", mirroring collapse+quoted_form); probe responses gated on generation+draft+authoredLabel via testable applyRelationLabelSuggestions; completion handler adopts only query-matching rows and never clobbers fresh rows; Inserts/canSubmit gated on freshness. Tests: 9 new in CaptureRelationPanelTests (pending/immediate-Return, fresh-quoted, edit-invalidation, stale-gen drop, label-mismatch drop, spelling units, delayed+out-of-order async with fake-bob) + 2 probe fixtures/branches. Validation: mac just typecheck-tests exit 0; Linux swift build + swift test 1554 pass; fake-bob branches exercised; helper logic executed (6/6 incl. bob parity). XCTest execution itself not run here (mac has no XCTest, Linux has no AppKit) — left for CI/lander. Task bead bob-cli-al left OPEN for the lander."}}
